📢 PUBLIC ADVISORY: EVENT RESCHEDULED TO SEPTEMBER 28

In light of the expected congestion and large crowds around the mall area due to the EDSA People Power Monument rally set on September 21, we have made the decision to reschedule our event to September 28, 2025, at the same time and venue.

This decision was made with the safety of our attendees and team as our top priority. We apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your understanding and continued support.

- Juancast and HORIWOOD Committee 

